# Web (entry)

Concern rules: `web-ui` (and later `web-api` when public client code exists). Map: [`.cursor/rules/README.md`](README.md).

- Phase 2 **customer** FE only. Locked stack: **Vite + React + TS** · Tailwind v4 · **shadcn/ui (radix-nova)** · **`@cabin/ui-tokens`** · **i18n en/id/zh** (`i18next`). Prerender/SSG for public marketing + listings; book/manage may stay CSR. Nest `/public` via browser `/api` → `/public`. CDN (Cloudflare default) in front of the public origin; never cache `/api/`.
- Same reservation/money domain as PMS (`source=WEBSITE`). No second booking DB. No Next.js unless explicitly chosen later.
- Tokens shared with PMS via `@cabin/ui-tokens`; shadcn components stay app-local. Details: [`apps/web/AGENTS.md`](../../apps/web/AGENTS.md).
- UI/UX: [`.cursor/rules/web-ui.mdc`](web-ui.mdc) + [`.cursor/skills/README.md`](../skills/README.md). Product truth: [`apps/web/PRODUCT.md`](../../apps/web/PRODUCT.md).
- Read `apps/web/AGENTS.md` + `_docs/reservations-design.md`. Client brief before inventing brand or guest cancel/refund UX.
